---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Marlin Hotel & Suites" description="Privacy information for the Marlin Hotel & Suites website.">
  <main class="legal-page shell">
    <span class="eyebrow">MARLIN HOTEL &amp; SUITES</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>This website provides information about Marlin Hotel &amp; Suites and ways to contact the hotel. It does not currently accept room bookings, online payments, or personal information through a website form.</p>
    <h2>Information and external services</h2>
    <p>When you visit, your browser may connect to providers that deliver website images, fonts, and embedded Google Maps. Those services may process technical information under their own privacy policies. Following a directions link or placing a telephone call takes you to an external service.</p>
    <h2>Session preferences</h2>
    <p>The site uses a browser session preference to avoid replaying its introductory animation every time you revisit the page during the same session.</p>
    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p>For questions about how the hotel handles information shared with reception, please contact the hotel directly.</p>
    <a class="button button--dark" href="/">Return to homepage</a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
